  "benefits": "\n  - **For General Category Farmers:** Financial assistance of ₹1,500/- per hectare, including ₹1,400/- for hybrid/improved seeds and ₹100/- for seed treatment medicine.  - **For Scheduled Caste/Scheduled Tribe Farmers:** Financial assistance of ₹2,250/- per hectare, including ₹2,100/- for hybrid/improved seeds and ₹150/- for seed treatment medicine.\n<br>\n\n",
